/Title (IGALP is a continuous Industry-Guided Applied Learning and Certification Program that helps students apply what they learn in their curriculum to real industry situations. Unlike conventional placement platforms that focus primarily on recruitment, IGALP introduces industry engagement very early in the student's graduation and continues this engagement throughout the entire journey through applied learning, capability assessment, and placement preparation.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 569 0 R
/Next 1600 0 R
>>
