/Title (Each weekly IGALP session combines exercises \(with and without AI\) covering concept application and cross-concept learning with industry-validated scenarios and placement preparation activities. Through continuous practice and periodic industry feedback, students learn to apply knowledge, analyse problems, use AI effectively, make decisions, understand interdisciplinary impacts, and navigate professional situations more confidently.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 570 0 R
/Prev 1603 0 R
>>
