/Title (This network enables institutions to bring industry situations and workplace contexts from organizations across different cities and regions into the academic environment, including companies that may not otherwise visit the campus. As the ecosystem expands, institutions gain greater opportunities for placements, internships, research, consultancy, and long-term industry collaboration.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 24 0 R
/Prev 572 0 R
